# `dh_missing --fail-missing` fails the build if anything `setup.py` stages in
# `debian/tmp` ends up in no binary package at all. List the deliberate
# omissions here so that the accidental ones keep failing the build.

# nothing in xpra reads its own metadata, and the `requires.txt` it contains
# names python distributions which the Debian packages already satisfy through
# their own dependencies - the rpm builds do ship it:
usr/lib/python3*/*/xpra-*.egg-info
usr/lib/python3*/*/xpra-*.egg-info/*
